Package: iperf3
Version: 3.16-r0.6
Description: Network benchmark tool
 iperf is a tool for active measurements of the maximum achievable
 bandwidth on IP networks. It supports tuning of various parameters
 related to timing, protocols, and buffers. For each test it reports the
 bandwidth, loss, and other parameters.
Section: console/network
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OE-Core Developers <openembedded-core@lists.openembedded.org>
License: BSD-3-Clause
Architecture: aarch64
OE: iperf3
Homepage: http://software.es.net/iperf/
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39+git5+e8f5217097), libcrypto3 (>= 3.2.2), libssl3 (>= 3.2.2)
Source: iperf3_3.16.bb
